This license covers only the original work in this repository: the written text,
layout, typographic and visual design choices, HTML/CSS source, and the specific
rulings and clarifications compiled here. It does NOT cover, and grants no rights
to, the copyrighted material of Arcs' rights holder — including but not limited
to the "Arcs" name and logo, game rules text, iconography, punchboard art, and
any imagery sourced or extracted from official Arcs products or the Arcs
Official Development Kit.

As of early 2026, Arcs (and Oath) are owned by Buried Giant Studios
(https://buriedgiant.com), the new studio founded by designer Cole Wehrle and
illustrator Kyle Ferrin after their departure from Leder Games; Leder Games
sold Arcs to Buried Giant and retained only Root. That material remains the
property of Buried Giant Studios / Cole Wehrle / Kyle Ferrin.

The assets in this repository (rulebook PDFs, dev-kit icons) were originally
released by Leder Games under its published policy for non-commercial fan
content:
https://ledergames.com/pages/leder-games-policy-on-fan-art-and-merchandise
Buried Giant Studios has not, as of this writing, published its own fan-content
policy that we could locate. This repository follows Leder's former policy as
the closest available precedent (free, non-commercial, clearly marked
unofficial) rather than as a confirmed rule from the current rights holder —
if Buried Giant Studios publishes its own policy, that should take precedence,
and this repository's practices should be checked against it.

